=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Audibert} in the {p:Scouts' Coalition}.
* Complete the following 3 tasks to complete the quest.
** You do not have to return to Audibert each time you complete one of the mini-quests. You may speak with him after all are finished, though you will need to interact with him three times.

+ Speak to {n:Corpo-Vorpo} in the {p:Peacekeepers' Coalition}. Travel Southeast from the Frontier Station in {z:Morimar Basalt Fields} and Examine the Daunting Emanation at (K-10) between 20:00-4:00 for a cutscene.{br}Return to {n:Audibert} for 400 bayld.
+ Speak to {n:Barenngo} in the {p:Pioneers' Coalition}. Travel North from Bivouac #1 in {z:Yahse Hunting Grounds}, take your first right then follow the left wall.{br}Examine the **Windblown Loam** at (J-6) for a cutscene.{br}Return to {n:Audibert} for 100 bayld.
+ Speak to {n:Dewalt} in the {p:Couriers' Coalition}.{br}Fish up a {k:Rusted pickaxe} in {z:Foret de Hennetiel}.{br}**Note**: The quest {q:Flavors of Our Lives|Flavors of Our Lives|Flavors of Our Lives} blocks progress to acquire the {k:Rusted pickaxe}, be sure {q:Flavors of Our Lives|Flavors of Our Lives|Flavors of Our Lives} is not active or you will not be able to fish up the {@k} {k:Rusted pickaxe}.{br}Return to {n:Audibert} for 700 bayld.

* Fishing right beside the {p:Homepoint} with any good fishing rod and any bait works well. A cheap rod may break. {i:Carbon Fishing Rod|Carbon Fishing Rod|17384}, {i:Halcyon Rod|Halcyon Rod|17015}, {i:Lu Shang's Fishing Rod|Lu Shang's Fishing Rod|17386} etc. will work.
* {p:Insect Ball} seemed to be an effective bait to use, aside from sometimes being able to fish up an arrowwood log when the same message below.
* {k:Rusted pickaxe} gives the same fishing message that items normally give but is a bit harder to reel in.

:* With max fishing skill, the {k:Rusted pickaxe} is very quick to fish up, like any other item without any noticeable difficulty.

* With low fishing skill, the {k:Rusted pickaxe} will sometimes give the Monster Reel-In Music instead of normal fishing reel-in music.
* Messages include:
** "You feel something pulling at your line."
** "You have a good feeling about this one!"
** "<Name> obtains a {k:Rusted pickaxe}!"

Notes:
* The {@k}{k:Rusted pickaxe} counts as a fished-up "rusted" item, and has been tested to qualify for objectives such as **Reel In Multiple Rusted Objects** from RoE and **Master Angler (VBD)** from Vana'Bout.
* Unlike the partial Bayld awards, this quest doesn't provide any fame for each part until you finish all three - it silently rewards you with that you only at the very end.

(determined with testing & attentiveness to {n:Iyvah Halohm}'s dialogs on alts)
